    "faq_home_prepurchase": {
      "type": "faq",
      "blocks": {
        "item_home01": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How does a kids audiobook player work?",
            "content": "<p>Each Voxblock audiobook is a sturdy block, like a board book, with the story stored inside. Your child slots it into the player and presses play, and the story starts. There is no screen, nothing to download and no internet connection needed.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_home02": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Does Voxblock need wifi, a phone or a subscription?",
            "content": "<p>No. There is nothing to download or stream, no subscription and nothing to set up. Take it out of the box, charge it and press play, at home, in the car or on holiday.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_home03": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What age is Voxblock for?",
            "content": "<p>Children aged 3 to 14+. Our library of 350+ audiobooks runs from picture books for <a href=\"/collections/voxblock-audiobooks-under-5s\">under 5s</a> to stories for <a href=\"/collections/audiobooks-5-8-years\">5 to 8s</a>, <a href=\"/collections/audiobooks-8-10-years\">8 to 10s</a> and <a href=\"/collections/audiobooks-10-to-teens\">10s to teens</a>, so the same player lasts for years.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_home04": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How long does the battery last?",
            "content": "<p>Up to 16 hours of listening on a full charge, enough for a long car journey or a week of bedtime stories. It charges with the USB-C cable in the box.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_home05": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Can my child use headphones?",
            "content": "<p>Yes. The player has a built-in speaker for listening out loud and a headphone jack for quiet listening in the car, on a plane or when a sibling is asleep.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_home06": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Is it good for bedtime?",
            "content": "<p>Yes. Bedtime mode plays the chosen story for 20 minutes, then the player goes to standby, so your child can drift off without a screen in the room.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_home07": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How is Voxblock different from Yoto or Tonies?",
            "content": "<p>Voxblock is a simpler alternative to Yoto and Tonies. Stories come on physical audiobook blocks rather than cards or figures that download audio, so there is no wifi, no downloads and no account to set up. <a href=\"/pages/voxblock-vs-yoto\" title=\"Voxblock vs Yoto\">See how they compare</a>.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_home08": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What's in the box?",
            "content": "<p>The player, a USB-C charging cable and a protective bumper if you choose one. Audiobooks are sold separately, or together in a <a href=\"/collections/voxblock-starter-pack-collection\">starter pack</a>.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_home09": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What if it's not right for us?",
            "content": "<p>Every player comes with a 100-day money-back guarantee, and UK delivery is free on orders over £25.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_home10": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What can my child listen to audiobooks on?",
            "content": "<p>On a phone, tablet or smart speaker, or on an audiobook player made for children. A player like Voxblock keeps listening screen-free: your child picks a story, slots it in and presses play, with nothing to download or stream and no screen to get drawn into.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_home11": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Is Voxblock suitable for toddlers?",
            "content": "<p>Voxblock is made for children aged 3 and over. The chunky blocks and simple buttons are easy for small hands, so most 3 year olds can choose and play a story on their own. For younger children, pick the story for them and listen together.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
